iful.","frame":"GPP0046Ku_8/022.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":96.43,"dur":1.17,"text":"Finance","frame":"GPP0046Ku_8/023.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":98.52,"dur":0.88,"text":"Solving problems, I guess.","frame":"GPP0046Ku_8/025.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":99.39,"dur":4.21,"text":"You know, just try to make people happy, you know? Just be that person. Everyone can lean on","frame":"GPP0046Ku_8/025.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"}],"turns":[{"t":10.89,"dur":1.63,"text":"Something dealing with youth.","frame":"GPP0046Ku_8/002.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":12.51,"dur":2.42,"text":"You know, awareness to the youth.","frame":"GPP0046Ku_8/002.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":14.93,"dur":1.58,"text":"Human Psycology","frame":"GPP0046Ku_8/003.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":16.52,"dur":1.17,"text":"People's rights.","frame":"GPP0046Ku_8/004.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":17.68,"dur":2.17,"text":"And we have rights.","frame":"GPP0046Ku_8/004.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":19.85,"dur":3.92,"text":"And they know we have rights, but they overlook the rights just to be on top.","frame":"GPP0046Ku_8/004.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":25.19,"dur":3.17,"text":"I couldn't tell you. What are you doing this for? The news?","frame":"GPP0046Ku_8/005.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":28.36,"dur":4.59,"text":"I would help people with cancer and stuff like a doctor","frame":"GPP0046Ku_8/006.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":32.95,"dur":6.26,"text":"Maybe something space related, Not so much like, you know, astronauts but maybe more so,","frame":"GPP0046Ku_8/007.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":39.21,"dur":1.83,"text":"like studying stars,","frame":"GPP0046Ku_8/007.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":41.04,"dur":1.92,"text":"Something astrology related.","frame":"GPP0046Ku_8/007.jpg","ro